<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Mozart returns twelve days after his nephrology consultation. The swelling has gone from his eyelids and ankles, his weight is back to his usual 61 kg, and his urine has been a normal color for a week. He finished penicillin four days ago. The joint aches and headaches have stopped. He did not have the creatinine and potassium check planned for a week after the consultation: he had concerts on three evenings and did not get to the laboratory. He has had no dizziness on standing, cramps, or palpitations. He has kept salt low and taken no NSAIDs. He is back to teaching and wants to stop the water tablet. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Swelling</td><td>Gone</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>61.2 kg, his usual</td></tr><tr><td>Urine</td><td>Normal color for a week</td></tr><tr><td>Antibiotic</td><td>Ten-day course finished</td></tr><tr><td>Missed test</td><td>One-week creatinine and potassium not done</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

