    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; energy returning</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No swelling, chest pain, or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Urine normal in color and amount</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Joint aches gone; no cramps</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache or dizziness on standing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

